 #: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:15
 msgid ""
-"PurRDF implements W3C [RDF Dataset Canonicalization (RDFC-1.0)](https://"
-"www.w3.org/TR/rdf-canon/) natively in the kernel, tested against the W3C "
-"`rdf-canon` fixture suite (65 vectors — 64 eval plus 1 negative — all green; "
-"see [`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/"
-"blob/main/docs/CONFORMANCE.md))."
+"The default canonical output is the canonical line sequence of the nested-"
+"refinement labelling (`CANON_LABELLING_NAME`, `CANON_LABELLING_VERSION`), "
+"spelled as N-Quads 1.2. Blank nodes are labelled `_:0`, `_:1`, and so on, in "
+"decimal, and the identity of a dataset is the 32-byte BLAKE3 digest of the "
+"line sequence. Reifiers, annotations, triple terms, composite literals that "
+"name blank nodes and declared empty graphs all take part, and no vocabulary "
+"is reserved. [Migrating to PurRDF 5.0](https://github.com/Blackcat-"
+"Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION-5.0.md) states the lowering "
+"exactly."
 msgstr ""
-"PurRDF 在内核中原生实现了 W3C [RDF 数据集规范化（RDFC-1.0）](https://"
-"www.w3.org/TR/rdf-canon/)，并依据 W3C `rdf-canon` 测试夹具套件进行测试（65 个"
-"向量——64 个求值用例加 1 个负例——全部通过；参见 [`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`]"
-"(https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
-"CONFORMANCE.md)）。"
+"默认的规范输出是嵌套细化标注（`CANON_LABELLING_NAME`、"
+"`CANON_LABELLING_VERSION`）的规范行序列，写作 N-Quads 1.2。空节点依次标记为十"
+"进制的 `_:0`、`_:1` 等，数据集的标识是该行序列的 32 字节 BLAKE3 摘要。具体化"
+"节点、注解、三元组项、指名空节点的复合字面量以及已声明的空图都参与其中，且不"
+"保留任何词汇。[迁移到 PurRDF 5.0](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
+"purrdf/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION-5.0.md)给出了精确的降级规则。"
 
