-#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:97
+#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:94
 msgid ""
-"**The flat form** — `canonical_flat_nquads` in `purrdf-rdf` rewrites the "
-"statement layer to plain `rdf:reifies` / annotation triples first and "
-"canonicalizes _that_ triple set under conformant RDFC-1.0. This is what the "
-"CLI's `convert --canonical`, the wasm `Dataset.canonicalize(\"unlimited\")` "
-"and the W3C conformance gate run."
+"PurRDF also implements W3C [RDF Dataset Canonicalization (RDFC-1.0)](https://"
+"www.w3.org/TR/rdf-canon/) natively, tested against the W3C `rdf-canon` "
+"fixture suite (65 vectors — 64 eval plus 1 negative — all green; see [`docs/"
+"CONFORMANCE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/"
+"docs/CONFORMANCE.md)). It lives under `purrdf_core::rdfc12` (also "
+"`purrdf_rdf::rdfc12`) and is not the default output: its labels are `c14nN` "
+"and its digest is SHA-256 or SHA-384 of N-Quads text. Use it to run the W3C "
+"algorithm by name, or to recompute a digest that PurRDF 4.x recorded. Over "
+"reifiers and annotations it has two 4.x forms, the flat form "
+"(`canonical_flat_nquads_with`) and the `purrdf-rdfc12` overlay, which agree "
+"with RDFC-1.0 byte for byte only on the RDF 1.1 subset; a digest over either "
+"must not be labelled RDFC-1.0. The normative text of the overlay is [`docs/"
+"RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/"
+"main/docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md)."
 msgstr ""
-"**扁平形式**——`purrdf-rdf` 中的 `canonical_flat_nquads` 先把陈述层重写为普通"
-"的 `rdf:reifies` / 注解三元组，再在符合规范的 RDFC-1.0 下对*该*三元组集合进行"
-"规范化。CLI 的 `convert --canonical`、wasm 的 "
-"`Dataset.canonicalize(\"unlimited\")` 以及 W3C 一致性关卡运行的都是这一形式。"
-
-#: src/concepts/canonicalization.md:102
-msgid ""
-"**The `purrdf-rdfc12` v3 profile** — `try_canonicalize` in `purrdf-core` "
-"keeps the statement layer and lowers it into a reserved `urn:purrdf:rdfc:` "
-"namespace instead (any input already carrying that namespace is refused, "
-"unless it is written in one of the two shapes the profile itself emits — "
-"those fold back into the statement layer, which is what makes "
-"canonicalization idempotent over its own output). It agrees with RDFC-1.0 "
-"byte for byte only on the RDF 1.1 subset, and a digest taken over its output "
-"**must not be labelled RDFC-1.0**; `CANON_PROFILE_ID` / "
-"`CANON_PROFILE_VERSION` name the profile at runtime. The normative text is "
-"[`docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
-"purrdf/blob/main/docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md)."
-msgstr ""
-"**`purrdf-rdfc12` v3 profile**——`purrdf-core` 中的 `try_canonicalize` 保留陈"
-"述层，并改为将其降级到保留的 `urn:purrdf:rdfc:` 命名空间中（任何已经携带该命"
-"名空间的输入都会被拒绝，除非它以该 profile 自身所输出的两种形态之一写成——这些"
-"形态会折叠回陈述层，这正是规范化在其自身输出上具有幂等性的原因）。它仅在 RDF "
-"1.1 子集上与 RDFC-1.0 逐字节一致，对其输出所取的摘要**不得标记为 RDFC-1.0**；"
-"`CANON_PROFILE_ID` / `CANON_PROFILE_VERSION` 在运行时指明该 profile。规范性文"
-"本是 [`docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
-"purrdf/blob/main/docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md)。"
+"PurRDF 还以原生方式实现了 W3C [RDF 数据集规范化（RDFC-1.0）](https://"
+"www.w3.org/TR/rdf-canon/)，并以 W3C `rdf-canon` 测试夹具套件进行测试（65 个向"
+"量——64 个求值加 1 个否定——全部通过；参见 [`docs/CONFORMANCE.md`](https://"
+"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/CONFORMANCE.md)）。它位"
+"于 `purrdf_core::rdfc12`（也可经 `purrdf_rdf::rdfc12` 访问），不是默认输出："
+"其标签为 `c14nN`，其摘要是 N-Quads 文本的 SHA-256 或 SHA-384。用它按名称运行 "
+"W3C 算法，或重新计算 PurRDF 4.x 记录的摘要。对于具体化节点与注解，它有两种 "
+"4.x 形式，即扁平形式（`canonical_flat_nquads_with`）和 `purrdf-rdfc12` 叠加形"
+"式，二者仅在 RDF 1.1 子集上与 RDFC-1.0 逐字节一致；针对任何一种形式取得的摘要"
+"都不得标记为 RDFC-1.0。叠加形式的规范性文本见 [`docs/RDF12-CANON-PROFILE.md`]"
+"(https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/RDF12-CANON-"
+"PROFILE.md)。"
 
